<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Docstring equations (1)–(4) match steady_state, jacobian, turing_report, simulate and modulate. The Lean file records the 12840 nm wavelength, the 9.295 diffusion ratio and the 0 Ma singleton series. It does not encode the real-eigenvalue formula, so code-traceability is not complete." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg kinetics, the steady state, the Jacobian and the onset formula k_c^2 = (D_v f_u + D_u g_v) / (2 D_u D_v) are implemented directly, and the PDE mode-growth Pearson against Re(σ) is 0.998. The pigment identification and the 12.84 µm length are a transfer onto A. nidulans, so this is not a line-by-line reproduction of a fungus paper." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — Morphometric validation: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Onset λ_c is 12.84 µm against the nominal 13 µm label. Dispersion Pearson is 0.998 with RMSE 0.014. Specimen pixel Pearson is 0.997 against a pure-stripe null near 0. Otsu IoU is 0.982, not 1. Equal-diffusion activator std is lower than the patterned std. Intensity KS is not the 12-bin Sobel histogram, and the wavelength was not repeated across seeds." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-sigma-goodness-of-fit-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-sigma-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-ablation-activator-std>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-onset-critical-wavelength-lambda-c>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-colony-mask-iou>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-intensity-ks-statistic>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-pixel-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-otsu-foreground-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-stripe-wavelength-from-activator-fft>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — MorphoEval overall 83.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1. Schnakenberg onset wavelength is fixed at 1.284e-05 m (12.84 µm, nominal 13 µm) for the Holocene singleton at 0 Ma. Dispersion Pearson is 0.9977. The colony GIF is specimen-conditioned, so specimen-match is 76. Sobel orientation, multi-seed CV, and the alpha measurement row are still open. Overall 83.8/100 (faithfulness 82.0, reproducibility 88.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.5.4, matplotlib Agg, Pillow 13.0.0, scipy 1.18.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 76, Parameter expressivity 86, Morphometric validation 84, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 275906 B, 1440×960 px, artifact_sha256 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd (sha256 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd), spec_fingerprint 8c34b8958cd42958d8cb0eb69ec1584db47478aa1296bac845f8f594052484e9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8c34b8958cd42958d8cb0eb69ec1584db47478aa1296bac845f8f594052484e9; artifact_sha256: 44bf1efce2b3c4b56ac56b363db0b1a0461956f82bb4a0ba2539fd98e6ec63bd; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=6b16f2c6f118230e..., datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=282a45a621880a69...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952): diffusion-driven instability and a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg (1979): the a - u + u^2 v / b - u^2 v kinetics. | Adams, Wieser and Yu (1998) and Clutterbuck (1969): conidial pigment development in A. nidulans, without a reaction-diffusion wavelength. | Trinci (1974): radial hyphal-colony expansion.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian, trace, determinant, cross term, discriminant, k_c and λ_c = 1.284e-05 m on a periodic grid with D_v/D_u = 9.295. | Equal-diffusion ablation, D_v sweep of λ_c, and PDE mode-growth versus the analytical eigenvalue. | Colony observable I = S * (1 - α + α (0.55 + 0.90 û)) with α = 0.12, revealed by a radial front.; transfer_boundary: The 13 µm label is the slot detail scale, not a length measured on the colony photograph. The photograph does not resolve 13 µm. | (u, v) are not identified with the wA polyketide or yA laccase proteins.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the spiral colony was predicted ab initio. The photograph supplies the macroscopic optical density. | Does not claim a predecessor chronospecies. The series is 1/1 at 0 Ma; the only comparison is to the 10 µm tier floor.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Compare 12-bin Sobel orientation histograms of the specimen and the GIF last frame; the pass-1 KS is on grayscale intensity only.",
        "remediation needed: Export the α-coupling sweep into measure_morphoeval so parameter expressivity is in the measurement sidecar.",
        "remediation needed: Run the nonlinear integrator from at least three seeds and report the coefficient of variation of the measured wavelength." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.38e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — Parameter expressivity: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Raising D_v shortens λ_c monotonically across 8.50–18, which is the wavenumber control the law claims. Raising α lowers pixel Pearson against the specimen monotonically. The α table is checked in the self-test and is not yet a measurement-sidecar row." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

