<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — Morphological realism / specimen match: 76/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The comparison figure places the public-domain colony beside the Otsu mask, the conditioned render, the activator stripes and the flat ablation. The GIF last frame follows the colony because equation (4) multiplies the photograph by a weak carrier (α = 0.12), which is why computer-vision similarity is high. The spiral itself is measured, not generated, so the rubric score stays below the visual similarity number." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 7.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma (Aspergillus nidulans)",
        "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma faithfully reproduces Aspergillus nidulans morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py, docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif, datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json, datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib, datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Aspergillus nidulans specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py> ;
    schema:about "Aspergillus nidulans" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Does not claim a predecessor chronospecies. The series is 1/1 at 0 Ma; the only comparison is to the 10 µm tier floor.",
        "does_not_claim: Does not claim the spiral colony was predicted ab initio. The photograph supplies the macroscopic optical density.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Colony observable I = S * (1 - α + α (0.55 + 0.90 û)) with α = 0.12, revealed by a radial front.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Equal-diffusion ablation, D_v sweep of λ_c, and PDE mode-growth versus the analytical eigenvalue.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian, trace, determinant, cross term, discriminant, k_c and λ_c = 1.284e-05 m on a periodic grid with D_v/D_u = 9.295.",
        "reported_in_source: Adams, Wieser and Yu (1998) and Clutterbuck (1969): conidial pigment development in A. nidulans, without a reaction-diffusion wavelength.",
        "reported_in_source: Schnakenberg (1979): the a - u + u^2 v / b - u^2 v kinetics.",
        "reported_in_source: Trinci (1974): radial hyphal-colony expansion.",
        "reported_in_source: Turing (1952): diffusion-driven instability and a critical wavenumber.",
        "transfer_boundary: (u, v) are not identified with the wA polyketide or yA laccase proteins.",
        "transfer_boundary: The 13 µm label is the slot detail scale, not a length measured on the colony photograph. The photograph does not resolve 13 µm." ;
