nly comparison is to the 10 µm tier floor.]; phenomenon_size: 12 µm (1.2e-05 m, log10=-4.921 m, tier=4_cellular_10um); species_scale_ladder (10 runs from 12 µm to 3.5 cm): 12 µm:aspergillus-nidulans-bioelectric-polarity, 43 µm:aspergillus-nidulans-vertex-packing, 768 µm:aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength, 1.5 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-clock-wavefront, 2.5 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-morphogen-condensation, 3.2 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-flux-canalization, 3.5 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-elastic-buckling, 4.1 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-branching-tree" ;
